    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184260/extras/33bff7c4bdb79f21b6800de27790e824.avif?t=1683642792\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184260/extras/2df6d6e6b23e3d0c2ca3c02dd032c3bb.poster.avif?t=1683642792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184260/extras/2df6d6e6b23e3d0c2ca3c02dd032c3bb.webm?t=1683642792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184260/extras/2df6d6e6b23e3d0c2ca3c02dd032c3bb.mp4?t=1683642792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Ricochet Blur is a fast-paced 2D top-down shooter set in a mysterious world. You are a professional slayer and your task is to eliminate demons using extraordinary guns that let your bullets bounce off walls.</strong><br><br>You will face a lot of difficulties and secrets throughout your adventure. Try to calculate your shots quickly and carefully or else you will fail.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184260/extras/a79448f01ef697b04043ede5fae51674.avif?t=1683642792\" /></div><br><strong>Don't forget to add Ricochet Blur to your wishlist so you know when it launches!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184260/extras/3bd28910ac1cb6d56eb8a5357d371ed9.poster.avif?t=1683642792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184260/extras/3bd28910ac1cb6d56eb8a5357d371ed9.webm?t=1683642792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store